      "minutes": 2,
      "content": "anarchy 無皇冠。monarchy／patriarchy／matriarchy／oligarchy／hierarchy 各式帽子。democracy／autocracy／bureaucracy／aristocracy／plutocracy 另一排帽子——導覽：hierarchy of evidence；拒 autocracy of one p。"
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
